msgstr "Nicht mehr in Kontors Katalog"

#: includes/Admin/HeldProducts.php:111
msgid "No stock record in Kontor"
msgstr "Kein Bestandssatz in Kontor"

#: includes/Admin/HeldProducts.php:112
